  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 2104.03 Identification of Cattle. All cattle entering New Hampshire shall be individually identified with permanent official identification.\n\nSource. #6959, eff 3-23-99; ss by #7452, eff 2-22-01; ss by #8423, eff 8-31-05; ss by #8848 eff 3-21-07, EXPIRED: 3-21-15 (from Agr 2103.03)\n\nNew. #10975, eff 11-19-15\n\nNew. #14570, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-4-26, EXPIRES: 10-31-26",
